      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "An inline formula such as score = relevance score = relevance must keep its TeX source so readers can render it.",
      "section_id": "math-inline-and-display-section-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The paragraph after the standalone equation keeps the surrounding prose in a separate section.",
      "section_id": "math-inline-and-display-section-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "A display formula embedded in prose a^2 + b^2 = c^2 a2 + b2 = c2 shares the paragraph with the text around it.",
      "section_id": "math-inline-and-display-section-3"
    }
  ]
